# ⭐ AETHERIA — HERO LEVEL, STAT & SKILL GROWTH SYSTEM

> **A Hero does not become stronger simply because their Level increases.**
>
> Their body becomes stronger.
>
> Their abilities evolve.
>
> Their experience changes how they fight.
>
> Their quests reveal hidden potential.
>
> And when a Hero reaches the highest Star Rank, they may awaken powers that ordinary Heroes can never obtain.

---

